        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3df9c00b1980410b912370115c7db67e",
      "statement": "Every task executes in its own isolated Git worktree on a task/<task_id> branch (setup_worktree creates <reponame>-worktrees/<task_id>), so a worker never touches main directly — the worktree + branch are the durable substrate that survives a worker crash.",
      "evidence": [
        {
