      "statement": "_handle_precommit_failure implements the self-healing loop: it increments metadata[precommit_retries] and, within ZEROFACTORY_MAX_PRECOMMIT_RETRIES (default 3), routes the task back to zf-builder in running status with the exact failing output; once retries are exhausted it moves the task to blocked for human inspection and posts a failure comment.",
