      "statement": "is_actionable_review_comment filters PR comments to genuine reviewer/human critiques: approval verdicts, builder-authored or automated notes (e.g. '[AI:zf-builder]' markers, 'builder verification', 'dedup note:'), and empty bodies are excluded, so only actionable feedback routes a task back to the builder.",
